armGroups.description:
* Trastuzumab-deruxtecan 5.4 mg/Kg, IV, d1 q3w;
* Capecitabine 1000 mg/sqm B.I.D, oral, dd1-14 q3w;
* Bevacizumab 7.5 mg/kg, IV, d1 q3w;

Treatment will be received until progressive disease, unacceptable toxicity, consent withdrawal, investigator's decision or study termination, whichever occurs first.
